#: ui/strength.slint:45
msgctxt "StrengthMeter"
msgid "· {} bits"
msgstr ""

#: ui/strength.slint:53
msgctxt "StrengthMeter"
msgid ""
"Worst realistic case: a site you use is breached and its password list leaks "
"with fast (MD5) hashes. An attacker runs hashcat on six RTX 4090 graphics "
"cards, about a trillion guesses per second, and on average finds the "
"password halfway through. Sites that store passwords properly (bcrypt, "
"Argon2) make this millions of times slower. Each extra bit doubles the time."
msgstr ""

